gate: decision.classify
skip_when: the subject text names the target type adr or rfc
budget: 1
taxonomy: Constraints & Tradeoffs, Completion Signals
produces: none
next: decision.cascade decision.adr decision.rfc

gate: decision.adr
skip_when: decision.classify selected decision.rfc
budget: 2
taxonomy: Constraints & Tradeoffs, Completion Signals
produces: adr draft
next: decision.cascade

gate: decision.rfc
skip_when: decision.classify selected decision.adr
budget: 2
taxonomy: Functional Scope & Behavior, Constraints & Tradeoffs
produces: rfc draft
next: decision.cascade

gate: decision.resolve
skip_when: no rfc draft covers the topic
budget: 1
taxonomy: Completion Signals, Constraints & Tradeoffs
produces: adr draft
next: decision.cascade end

gate: decision.cascade
skip_when: the track produced an rfc, or the ADR content matches neither signal set below
budget: 1
taxonomy: Constraints & Tradeoffs, Integration & External Dependencies, Completion Signals
produces: rule and guide (standard cascade), or spec and plan (architecture cascade); when the decision describes a before/after code-pattern shift, the executing skill MAY create a cpat before the rule draft
next: end

